    "body": "## Summary\n- require a non-blank administrator reason for every `SUSPENDED -> ACTIVE` recovery\n- persist the normalized reason in the immutable reactivation audit and expose it in audit history\n- add Flyway V29 with a legacy backfill marker plus a database-level non-blank constraint\n- require the reason in the admin web UI before enabling reactivation and show it in audit history\n- extend backend regression coverage and account/access documentation\n\n## Safety / privacy\nThis does not create a new status-change path. Direct suspension through the generic endpoint remains forbidden; only already-suspended accounts can be reactivated. Reasons remain inside the existing `ROLE_ADMIN` audit surface and contain no location, escrow, route or payment data by design.\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build, Flyway/runtime smoke and existing identity/security gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
